---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Gallery" description="Real Chudware workspaces rendered by the desktop application's scenario harness.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Gallery</p><h1>Product work, inside the actual product.</h1><p class="lede">These images are captured from Chudware's headless scenario harness, not composited interface mockups.</p></div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap gallery-grid">
    <figure class="panel gallery-card"><img src="/images/modeling.png" width="1340" height="838" alt="A parametric enclosure taking shape in the Chudware modeling workspace" /><figcaption><h2>Parametric enclosure</h2><p>Ordered box, fillet, and shell features remain editable in the feature tree while the copilot works beside the model.</p></figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="panel gallery-card"><img src="/images/cam.png" width="1340" height="838" alt="Chudware CAM workspace showing stock, operations, and a simulated toolpath" /><figcaption><h2>Manufacturing plan</h2><p>Stock, tools, operations, simulation, and post output share the design document.</p></figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="panel gallery-card"><img src="/images/onboarding.png" width="1340" height="838" alt="Chudware onboarding workspace setup screen" /><figcaption><h2>Guided setup</h2><p>Account, workstation profile, AI provider, and project location are explained before the first design opens.</p></figcaption></figure>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
